WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.107
The headline: Midpoint-Displacement tuned to
imitate CCS gives probe directions averaging

00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:10.556
cosine similarity about zero point six three to
real CCS probes,

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:14.726
while CCS agrees with itself only at zero point
seven eight.

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:18.897
Other accurate losses like PCA sit near zero point
one five,

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:22.790
so the resemblance is specific to Midpoint-Displacement.
